      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [
          {
            "title": "Photos and a first look",
            "body": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Send a few lines about your organ through the form below. When Frank replies, you can send him photos of the case, the façade, the key frame and anything that no longer works. They tell him a lot before he sees the organ.",
                "spans": []
              }
            ],
            "image": {},
            "image_brief": null
          },
          {
            "title": "Inspection",
            "body": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Frank looks at the organ itself to see what it needs and what is still original. Every organ is different, so Frank decides case by case whether he comes to you or the organ comes to the atelier.",
                "spans": []
              }
            ],
            "image": {},
            "image_brief": null
          },
          {
            "title": "Written proposal",
            "body": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "You receive a written proposal describing the work Frank recommends, so you know what will be done before anything starts. What it covers depends on the organ and the work it needs.",
                "spans": []
              }
            ],
            "image": {},
            "image_brief": null
          },
          {
            "title": "Restoration",
            "body": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The work is done by hand in the atelier, part by part, with respect for what the original builder made.",
                "spans": []
              }
            ],
            "image": {},
            "image_brief": null
          },
          {
            "title": "Voicing and delivery",
            "body": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Frank voices and tunes the organ and returns it to you playing. Whether he sets it up on site is agreed for each organ.",
                "spans": []
              }
            ],
            "image": {},
            "image_brief": null
          }
        ],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "How Frank works",
          "title": "From the first photo to the first tune",
          "intro": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Every organ is different, so every restoration starts with looking before quoting.",
              "spans": []
            }
          ],
          "tone": "Default"
        },
